WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of the Vietnamese narration script. Timing is distributed proportionally within each slide segment, since the narration itself is in Vietnamese.

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.424
Hello everyone, this is the guide video for Lab 1: Document formality.

2
00:00:05.424 --> 00:00:08.756
Watch this video before coming to the computer lab,

3
00:00:08.756 --> 00:00:11.500
and feel free to replay it while you work.

4
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.660
The lab session follows five steps: the teacher demonstrates on the projector,

5
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.035
you follow along, then you complete the assigned exercise on your own,

6
00:00:21.035 --> 00:00:24.457
you mark each other's work in pairs, and finally you submit and revise.

7
00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:28.900
Remember to bring a laptop with Microsoft Word installed and Decree 30 downloaded in advance.

8
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.775
Step one: set up the page.

9
00:00:32.775 --> 00:00:37.144
Go to the Layout tab, choose Size, select A4 — never leave it on Letter size.

10
00:00:37.144 --> 00:00:40.637
Still in the Layout tab, choose Margins, then Custom Margins:

11
00:00:40.637 --> 00:00:44.532
set the top and bottom margins to twenty to twenty-five millimetres,

12
00:00:44.532 --> 00:00:49.342
the left margin to thirty to thirty-five, and the right margin to fifteen to twenty.

13
00:00:49.342 --> 00:00:53.427
Choose Times New Roman as the font, size thirteen or fourteen, in black.

14
00:00:53.427 --> 00:00:57.085
Number the pages using Insert, Page Number, Top of Page, Center,

15
00:00:57.085 --> 00:01:01.200
then tick Different First Page to remove the number from the first page.

16
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.707
Step two: format the header section.

17
00:01:05.707 --> 00:01:08.257
The national title is capitalised and bold,

18
00:01:08.257 --> 00:01:12.823
the motto is bold with each initial letter capitalised and joined by hyphens,

19
00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:14.839
with a horizontal line underneath.

20
00:01:14.839 --> 00:01:19.580
The issuing body's name goes in the top left corner, also with a line underneath.

21
00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.390
The reference number sits below the body's name.

22
00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:26.343
The place and date of issue are italicised, placed below the motto;

23
00:01:26.343 --> 00:01:30.000
note that any day or month below ten must have a leading zero.

24
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.460
Step three: the middle and closing sections.

25
00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.877
The document type and its summary line are centred, capitalised and bold.

26
00:01:37.877 --> 00:01:39.152
The body text is justified,

27
00:01:39.152 --> 00:01:43.495
with the first line of each paragraph indented about one to one-point-two-seven centimetres.

28
00:01:43.495 --> 00:01:45.625
The signature block sits in the bottom right:

29
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:47.993
the delegated authority and title are capitalised,

30
00:01:47.993 --> 00:01:51.687
leave three to four blank lines for the signature, then the full name in bold.

31
00:01:51.687 --> 00:01:53.762
The distribution list is in the bottom left,

32
00:01:53.762 --> 00:01:58.100
with the last line always being a bullet reading “Lưu: VT”, meaning “File: Clerical Office”.

33
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.895
Before submitting, run through this eight-point checklist yourself:

34
00:02:03.895 --> 00:02:07.543
paper size and margins, a consistent font, the national title and motto,

35
00:02:07.543 --> 00:02:10.532
the reference number, the date and place, the summary line,

36
00:02:10.532 --> 00:02:12.711
the signature block and title, and finally,

37
00:02:12.711 --> 00:02:15.700
whether the distribution list ends with the “Lưu: VT” line.

38
00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:18.400
This is exactly the checklist I use to mark your work.

39
00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:25.535
Assignment 1: fully format an official notice issued by An Phat Co., Ltd.,

40
00:02:25.535 --> 00:02:29.374
announcing the Lunar New Year holiday schedule to all staff.

41
00:02:29.374 --> 00:02:31.944
The body only needs three to five lines,

42
00:02:31.944 --> 00:02:34.772
since the focus of grading is the formality.

43
00:02:34.772 --> 00:02:39.027
Work individually and submit a Word file by the end of the session.

44
00:02:39.027 --> 00:02:40.127
Good luck.
